#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000251
msgid "Hm?  What are you doing?!"
msgstr "嗯？干嘛？！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000252
msgid "Eh? You're not going anywhere!"
msgstr "呃？你哪儿也别想去！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000253
msgid "Huh? ...Hm, checks out OK."
msgstr "咦？……嗯，检查没问题。"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000254
msgid "You! Stop!"
msgstr "你！站住！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000255
msgid "Break time!"
msgstr "休息！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000256
msgid "Your turn!"
msgstr "轮到你了！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000257
msgid "Whatcha got here?"
msgstr "藏了啥？"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000258
msgid "Prisoner escaped! Security team, search the area!"
msgstr "囚犯逃跑了！警卫队，搜索区域！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000259
#: slot/0x00e2e8b4/0x9eda9d/0x000000
msgid "Nice try!"
msgstr "想得美！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00025a
msgid "Ya hear that? You'll be singing the same tune before long."
msgstr "听见没？你迟早也会唱同一出戏。"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00025b
msgid "Who's next? Get 'em in here!"
msgstr "下一个谁？带进来！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00025c
msgid "Don't be getting any ideas."
msgstr "别动什么歪脑筋。"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00025d
msgid "Quiet, you."
msgstr "闭嘴。"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00025e
msgid "STOP IT!"
msgstr "住手！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00025f
msgid "Blue team, search for the intruders. Gold team, guard the elevators. Go!"
msgstr "蓝队，搜索入侵者。金队，守住电梯。行动！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000261
#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x00003c
msgid "Got it!"
msgstr "明白！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000262
msgid "Yes, sir!"
msgstr "是！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000263
msgid "They're calling for backup up top. Come on!"
msgstr "上面在叫增援。快走！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000264
msgid "Right behind you!"
msgstr "跟在你后面！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000271
msgid "They'll never find me here..."
msgstr "他们找不到我……"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000272
msgid "Fools..."
msgstr "蠢货……"

#: slot/0x00a57df4/0x24576f/0xe05055
msgid "Undo the prisoner's restraints."
msgstr "解开囚犯的束缚。"

#: slot/0x00a57df4/0x24576f/0xe15055
msgid ""
"Open the cell door.\n"
msgstr "打开牢房门。\n"

#: slot/0x00a57df4/0x24576f/0xe25055
msgid "Increase the voltage."
msgstr "提高电压。"

#: slot/0x00a57df4/0x24576f/0xe35055
msgid "Decrease the voltage."
msgstr "降低电压。"

